<tr><td class="fieldname"><a id="a4ad542bdb9766f9d97ea5a72cd85f5b9a86618ee5fca90548080d5bebe098cbf0" name="a4ad542bdb9766f9d97ea5a72cd85f5b9a86618ee5fca90548080d5bebe098cbf0"></a>StartServerFailed&#160;</td><td class="fielddoc"><p>Server failed to bind. </p>
